# Atlas Core Component Tokens Specification
**Author:** Pixel Nkosi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 14:30  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Comprehensive W3C-compliant component design token definitions for Atlas Core, mapping SaaS and Face to Face interface tokens with explicit documentation grounded in company strategy.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "module": "component-tokens",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": "Pixel Nkosi",
    "docsEvangelism": "All tokens must be consumed through semantic component aliases rather than primitive scales to enforce strict theme portability between SaaS Platform UI and Face to Face Service kiosks.",
    "governance": {
      "referenceDocument": "Business Document: Company Document",
      "usageDescription": "Referenced Business Document: Company Document to align touch target sizing, high-visibility contrast ratios, and physical service-point compliance requirements across both digital SaaS dashboards and Face to Face physical service terminals."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "default": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.600}", "$type": "color", "$description": "Default button fill satisfying AA compliance on light surface." },
          "hover": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.700}", "$type": "color" },
          "pressed": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.800}", "$type": "color" },
          "disabled": { "$value": "{color.neutral.200}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "text": {
          "default": { "$value": "{color.neutral.0}", "$type": "color" },
          "disabled": { "$value": "{color.neutral.500}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "spacing": {
          "paddingX": { "$value": "{space.4}", "$type": "dimension" },
          "paddingY": { "$value": "{space.3}", "$type": "dimension" },
          "minHeight": { "$value": "{size.touchTarget.min}", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Guarantees 44px min touch target for Face to Face terminals." }
        },
        "radius": { "$value": "{radius.md}", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```